<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-code-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion, G-fiber overwinding & Pass 3 thigmotropic contact coiling — Code-to-model traceability: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring (L1-L78) maps Laws 1-5 to the papers and to the five Lean 4 theorems in `MathOfBiology.Loop_064`, and carries an explicit Pass 3 scope statement (L70-L77). The section 3b header (L414-L445) writes out every energy term, the friction scheme and the NOT-implemented list; function docstrings cite Darwin Ch. IV, Jaffe & Galston and Euler. The math KG YAML registers equations 4-5 with single-range `code_locus` pins (L596-L909, L911-L977) and refreshed Pass 2 loci. Deductions: `_wrap_statistics` is documented as counting loose loops but the panel G title reports N without that qualifier (-2); the \"axis-seeking\" curvature direction proxy is described in the header but the parallel-transport fallback for non-touching nodes (L655-L676) has no literature anchor (-2); returned keys `_last_objective`, `_mat_dir`, `_last_opt_message` (L897-L899) are unused, and `last_objective` would be unbound if `t_end_min` < `dt_min` (-1); the comparison figure's section-6 banner still says \"6-Panel\" (L1221) while the figure has 8 panels (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py L1221–L1222: Section 6 banner still reads '6-Panel Synthesis Figure' although render_comparison_figure now draws 8 panels <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py#L1221-L1222>",
        "1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py L897–L899: Unused private return keys _last_objective, _mat_dir, _last_opt_message; last_objective unbound when n_steps = 0 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py#L897-L899>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-code-traceability-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-code-traceability-4> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion, G-fiber overwinding & Pass 3 thigmotropic contact coiling — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 core intact: Timoshenko G-fiber bilayer kappa_0, exact T_c = B kappa_0^2/(1+Gamma) and helix equilibrium (L164-L246), 161-node L-BFGS-B Kirchhoff perversion solver with zero-link enforcement and kappa_0 = 0 / T >= T_c controls (L249-L411). Pass 3 adds a physically reasoned reduced contact model: contact-gated intrinsic curvature with signal propagation (`kappa0_field` L629-L632; Lean Law 4), implicit backward-Euler incremental potential with penalty cylinder contact and |i-j| >= 3 self-contact, and Coulomb dissipation potentials for support and self-contact friction (L741-L761; Lean Law 5), with a grip test against mu*sum(N) and the capstan gain (L836-L875). Deductions: the contact rod is bending-only with no material-frame twist, so Gamma never enters contact coiling and the two solvers are not one model (-4); the preferred-curvature direction is an \"axis-seeking\" proxy (unit vector toward the support axis, frozen per macro step, L642-L654) rather than curvature toward the actual touched flank, which makes wrapping partly a construction of the model (-2); friction normal forces are lagged one step and the stick/slip law is Huber-regularised, so stick is approximate (-1); the rod is placed already touching the support at 25 % of L with a fixed 55 deg approach (`_initial_rod` L516-L530), so there is no first-touch event to model (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity-6> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-morphometric-validation> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion, G-fiber overwinding & Pass 3 thigmotropic contact coiling — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1817-L1984) now returns 15 measurements with reference values, methods, notes and negative controls: 9 from Pass 2 and 6 Pass 3 (L1830-L1891). Pass 2 values re-read from the current output: T_c = 0.3018 mN (ref 0.3018), pitchfork cos(theta) r = 0.9974, |Delta_Lk| = 0, soft overwinding r = 0.9806, 4-species r = 0.9999, super-critical z/L = 1.0, specimen CV 0.298 (ref 0.22). Deductions: the v2 audit quoted Gerbode peak overwinding \"+0.5873 turns\" and kappa_0 \"0.6545 mm^-1\" but the script reports 0.7171 turns (ref 0.58, +24 %, L1925-L1933) and 0.4976 mm^-1 (ref 0.65, -23 %, L1955-L1963), so two of the nine Pass 2 anchors miss their references by about a quarter and the v2 score rested on misquoted numbers (-5); the Pass 3 N_wrap measurement uses the internal no-support control as `reference_value` (L1831-L1840) and the support-radius ratio has `reference_value: None` (L1881-L1890), so neither is a comparison with data (-3); time-to-first-wrap 4.75 min is set by the assumed tau_thigmo and v_signal and falls slightly below Darwin's 5-60 min window whose midpoint 32.5 min is the reference (L1841-L1850) - the note says \"NOT an independent validation\", which is credited (-2); F_hold / mu*sum(N) = 0.67 (L1851-L1860) is a consistency check of the lagged-normal scheme, not an experiment (-1); specimen pitch CV 0.298 vs 0.22 persists (-1). The frictionless-control and self-contact non-penetration checks are genuine falsifiable physics constraints and are credited." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py L1925–L1933: Gerbode soft peak overwinding: script value 0.7171 turns vs reference 0.58 (+24 %); v2 audit quoted +0.5873 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py#L1925-L1933>",
        "1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py L1955–L1963: G-fiber bilayer kappa_0: script value 0.4976 mm^-1 vs reference 0.65 (-23 %); v2 audit quoted 0.6545 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8a7928d7/1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py#L1955-L1963>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-measurement-4-species-climbing-plant-helical-coil-radius-correlation-cucumis-passiflora-bryonia-echinocystis>,
