        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-measurement-pass-3-coulomb-grip-holding-load-f-hold-over-amontons-coulomb-capacity-mu-sum-n-i-median-over-mu-in-0-3-0-6-0-9>,
